  "bodyHash": "4f7db7cc14310dcb",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 關於 Elden Ring Nightreign 裝備</strong></h2>\n<p>FazBrick Studios 團隊呈現 <em>Elden Ring Nightreign Gear</em>。這是一款簡潔輕量的模組，將來自遊戲 <em>Elden Ring: Nightreign</em> 的六套經典護甲帶入 Minecraft。</p>\n<p>本模組旨在與原版遊戲完美融合，讓玩家在探索 Minecraft 世界時也能享受傳說級護甲的外觀。</p>\n<p><em>Elden Ring Nightreign Gear</em> 相容於現代版本的 Minecraft，並將根據需要進行小幅更新。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73fec028-7748-4d80-9af6-ffa984bbf233.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c88b3124-8b97-41c1-ac97-3978b3b5c76d.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5c4b67d5-da89-487b-a776-2554b9096719.png\"></p>\n<p><strong> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fMrFazCraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_fe39d778-c7f5-4342-8aed-fb925a1c4e16.png\"> </a></strong></p>\n<p>🗡️ <strong>立即展開你的黑暗靈魂旅程！</strong> 透過 Nitrado 和 Apex Hosting 提供的一鍵伺服器安裝功能，你與你的朋友可以瞬間沉浸在 <strong>黑暗靈魂擴充套件</strong> 的嚴酷世界中！</p>\n<p>要開始遊玩，你只需要一個至少擁有 <strong>4GB 記憶體或以上</strong> 的 Minecraft Java 伺服器（建議使用以支援多人遊玩更流暢）。只需在控制台中<strong>點擊一次</strong>，即可立即安裝 <strong>黑暗靈魂擴充套件 [CurseForge]</strong>，今天就開始你驚險的冒險之旅！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>也試試官方的黑暗靈魂擴充套件整合包吧！</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/echoes-of-londor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_49fcd2fd-eab0-49e9-b7e0-c1bedc4653d4.png\" width=\"281\" height=\"286\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以將此模組放入整合包中嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p>當然可以！請隨意將此模組加入您的整合包中。我們非常鼓勵您這麼做，只需記得註明出處即可。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 重新分發授權條款</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>未經許可，不得將此模組上傳或重新分發至 Curseforge 以外的網站或網域。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>這特別包含 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
